OL,3,AMI5 chief warns of threats to UK from
OL,4,ARussia, Iran and AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FMI5 is devoting more resource to
OL,7,Fcountering state threats than during
OL,8,Fthe Cold War, the head of the
OL,9,Fintelligence service has said, as he
OL,10,Flabelled Russia "aggressor number one".
OL,12,FSir Ken McCallum warned MI5 was now
OL,13,Ffacing a situation in which "our
OL,14,Fterrorism and state threats operational
OL,15,Fmissions are pretty much of equal
OL,16,Fscale" as threats from foreign
OL,17,Fadversaries have quadrupled over the
OL,18,Flast decade.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
