OL,3,AUS emergency call records reveal
OL,4,Aconfusion after failed execution of
OL,5,AChrista Pike
OL,6,
OL,7,FEmergency call records have revealed
OL,8,Fthe confusion that developed among
OL,9,Fprison staff and emergency call
OL,10,Fhandlers after the execution of
OL,11,Fconvicted murderer Christa Pike went
OL,12,Fwrong last month in Tennessee.
OL,14,FPike, 50, who killed Colleen Slemmer
OL,15,Falongside her then-boyfriend in 1995,
OL,16,Fwas given two doses of lethal injection
OL,17,Fon 30 September. Once it became clear
OL,18,Fthat she was not going to die from the
OL,19,Fdosage, she was taken to hospital.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
