OL,3,AUS emergency call records reveal
OL,4,Aconfusion after failed execution of
OL,5,AChrista Pike
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe confusion resulted in part from an
OL,8,Fapparent disconnect between prison
OL,9,Fstaff, according to the AP news agency,
OL,10,Fwhich first obtained audio of the
OL,11,Femergency calls.
OL,13,FThis allegedly delayed Pike's
OL,14,Ftreatment. The BBC has asked the state
OL,15,Fcorrections department for comment.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
